<title>UK: Queens Moat sells 91.5 mln stg portfolio.</title>
<headline>Queens Moat sells 91.5 mln stg portfolio.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Troubled UK hotels group Queens Moat confirmed on Monday that it was selling 19 county hotels and six Moat houses for 91.5 million stg to a management buy-in group.</p>
<p>The company said that the disposal, which would cut its debt repayment burden for 1997 and 1998 &quot;substantially&quot;, represented an important step in its recovery.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4020</p>
